  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-02T00:24:01.529Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The latest update seems to have added a \"Standard Lite\" shader to the builtin shaders in the SDK.\n\nCan we get one for Unlit Texture too? Currently you can make an Unlit Quest avatar by just abusing Emission in Standard Lite, but obviously that is quite wasteful. Providing Unlit Texture directly would be an improvement.",
